  "content": "<h1>我剛剛殺了什麼？</h1>\n<h4>顯示一個小型提示框，展示你剛剛擊殺的生物資訊</h4>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n\n提示框中顯示的資訊可以透過設定進行調整  \n更多資訊請參閱維基\n<a title=\"維基\" href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/WhatDidIJustKill/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">此處</a>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n\n<h3>範例圖片</h3>\n\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1MXM1y4/entity-normal.png\" alt=\"一般實體\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/W59MNM3/entity-one-line.png\" alt=\"單行實體\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rHcdCxR/entity-one-line-no-distance.png\" alt=\"無距離實體\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zrnmvrr/entity-normal-named.png\" alt=\"命名實體\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CMPx6N0/player-normal.png\" alt=\"一般玩家\" border=\"0\">\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n\n你是模組開發者，想為你的實體添加支援嗎？\n<br/>\n請參考這份<a title=\"指南\" href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/WhatDidIJustKill/wiki/Modded-Entities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">指南</a>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n\n如果你對這個模組有任何疑問，或想了解即將推出的功能：\n<br>\n歡迎加入 &nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">連結</a>",
